<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Craft frontier guns like revolvers, rifles, and shotguns.-->
  <VWEFT_FrontierWeapons.description>制作左轮手枪、步枪和霰弹枪等边境枪支。</VWEFT_FrontierWeapons.description>
  <VWEFT_FrontierWeapons.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->echoes of the frontier-->
    <li>subject-&gt;边疆的回声</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->revived the rugged spirit of the frontier, crafting firearms that embody the essence of survival and exploration-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重振边疆的粗犷精神，打造体现生存和探索本质的枪械</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->perfected the art of gunsmithing to produce revolvers, rifles, and shotguns, tools as much for defense as for forging ahead into the unknown-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;完善了枪械制造艺术，生产出左轮手枪、步枪和霰弹枪，这些工具既可用于防御，也可用于向未知领域前进</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->imbued each weapon with the reliability and durability needed to face the untamed wilds and protect burgeoning communities-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;使每件武器都具有面对未驯服的荒野和保护新兴社区所需的可靠性和耐用性</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->carving out civilization's edge with the steadfast companionship of frontier firearms-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;在边疆枪械的坚定陪伴下开拓文明的边缘</li>
  </VWEFT_FrontierWeapons.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: frontier weapons-->
  <VWEFT_FrontierWeapons.label>边疆武器</VWEFT_FrontierWeapons.label>
</LanguageData>
